# ── Fix B — the shared evidence cache (utils/cache.py) ───────────────────
# EVIDENCE_CACHE_DIR defaults to tests/fixtures. Two of its namespaces are
# committed on purpose — a page read and a Wikidata item are claims about what
# a source said on a day, and a thesis re-run has to reproduce the decisions
# they drove. The other four are derived and cheap to re-gather, so they are
# ignored here by default. Un-ignore them to commit a frozen evaluation set —
# the runs behind determinism_findings.md were measured against exactly that,
# and `llm/` in particular is what makes a re-run reproduce the model's
# answers rather than re-ask for them.
tests/fixtures/serp/
tests/fixtures/registry/
tests/fixtures/fetch/
tests/fixtures/llm/

# Dated backups of moved evidence-cache namespaces (see utils/cache.py).
_cache_backup_*/

# ── Customer master data / PII ────────────────────────────────────────────
# SAP customer records carry organisation names, street addresses, contact
# names and email addresses. This repository is PUBLIC — no row-level customer
# data may be committed. Keep sample workbooks local, or sanitise before
# sharing. (Note: several data workbooks predate this rule and are already in
# history — see the audit; removing them needs a history rewrite.)
docs/results/
.scratch/agentic-enrichment/tmp/
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
!.github/**/*.csv
# Run artefacts and caches can embed the same rows.
logs/
